/*
  # Upgrade Chemistry Topics 16-20 with Comprehensive Notes

  ## Summary
  Replaces existing topic sections for Chemistry Topics 16-20 with high-quality, in-depth notes
  tailored for WASSCE students across West Africa.

  ## Topics Covered
  1. Topic 16 - Polymers and Plastics
  2. Topic 17 - Industrial and Agricultural Chemistry
  3. Topic 18 - Environmental Chemistry
  4. Topic 19 - Qualitative Analysis
